  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Extra Paper Thin 24\" Baseline1: built from SPEAR captures (Bell V1-V3, Bow V1-V3, Edge V1, V2 and V6; bow and bell with the stick tip, edge with the shoulder) by build_preset.py: 900-mode bank from bow and edge partials (0.3 % clusters; exc from the bow captures only, 80th-percentile presence, gamma 0.8, <400 Hz x0.65), decay-fitted T60 calibrated per band to the SPEAR band decay (t60_scale 1.0), NPZ edge in the plugin's 22 bands with edge_rms_correction from the velw norms. Build-up as Bettis/Swish. Built with --low-wash. Edge V3 and V5 left out: V5 is quieter than V3, and V3's strong 283 Hz swell made a medium edge render quieter than a soft one. T60s refit from Bow V1-V3 as KONSTAN's (docs/BASELINE_MANIFEST.md), meant to be baked without V19's cap."
